      "content": "i know people say it gets better but it doesn't feel like that. it feels like the only good thing in my life is just... finished. and now i'm just stuck in this house waiting for nothing. everything feels so hollow and pointless, like i'm just going through the motions in a world that doesn't even feel real anymore.",
