      "content": "it's hard to reach out to anyone when they don't get it. they just tell me it was \"just a dog\" or that i'll find something else. but there isn't anything else. it's like the light just went out in everything. i'm just sitting here thinking about how much easier it would be if i didn't have to feel this silence anymore. if it could just be over.",
